      <title>Transmitter Installation Has Begun</title>
      <link>https://www.wlmb.com/post/transmitter-installation-has-begun</link>
      <description>We are excited to get started on the transmitter installation today. As of this writing, we are still on track to make the switch to channel 35 by September 30th. Please continue to pray for WLMB as we go through this construction process.</description>
