    <item>
      <title>The Antenna Has Arrived!</title>
      <link>https://www.wlmb.com/post/the-antenna-has-arrived</link>
      <description>These photos show the arrival and unloading. We are thrilled that it is here! Please read this update from us on what you can expect over the next few days while we make the switch from channel 5 to channel 35. By this weekend, WLMB will be off the air for most viewers and for several days to replace our transmitter and antenna. Our current target is to be back on the air on or after October 1st at 2:00 PM. Those who watch over the air television will need to rescan their TV’s after the transiti</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wlmb.com/post/the-antenna-has-arrived</guid>
